---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = '27 July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What MESvantage collects when you visit this website, who processes it, and how to reach us about it."
>
  <section class="bg-navy text-white py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent-onDark uppercase">Privacy</span>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight">
        What this website collects, and what it doesn't.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-muted-onDark">Last updated {updated}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10 text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">The short version</h2>
        <p>
          This website sets no cookies. It runs no advertising or profiling. It embeds no forms —
          the product overview downloads directly, and the normal way to reach us is to send an
          email, which means you decide what we hold about you. There is one optional form,
          hosted by Google and linked from the about page; it is clearly labelled, it opens in a
          new tab, and nothing of Google's loads unless you choose to click it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">Who the controller is</h2>
        <p>
          MESvantage Limited, a company registered in Ireland, is the data controller for this
          website. Reach us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@mesvantage.com" class="text-accent font-semibold hover:text-accent-dark">hello@mesvantage.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Plausible Analytics to count page views. Plausible is EU-owned and EU-hosted,
          sets no cookies, and creates no persistent identifier for you. It does process your IP
          address in order to derive a country and to de-duplicate visits within a day; the IP
          address itself is not stored. Our lawful basis is legitimate interest in understanding
          whether the site works. Because there is no non-essential cookie and no persistent
          identifier, there is nothing here for you to consent to and no banner to dismiss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">Processors</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-navy">Vercel</span> — hosting and content delivery. Server logs including IP address, retained by Vercel for a short operational period.</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-navy">Plausible Analytics</span> — page-view analytics, EU-hosted, cookieless.</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-navy">Microsoft 365</span> — the mailbox behind hello@mesvantage.com.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Fonts are self-hosted on this domain. No request is made to Google, and there are no
          embedded third-party frames. If you follow the optional link to our contact form, that
          form is hosted by Google and their terms apply from the moment you open it — which is
          why it is a link you choose rather than something loaded on your behalf.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">If you email us</h2>
        <p>
          We keep your message and address for as long as we are in contact and for a reasonable
          period afterwards, so that we can pick the conversation back up. We do not add you to a
          mailing list, because we do not have one.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us for a copy of anything we hold about you, ask us to correct or erase it,
          or object to our processing it. Email us and we will respond. If you are not satisfied,
          you can complain to the Irish Data Protection Commission at
          <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ie" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-accent font-semibold hover:text-accent-dark">dataprotection.ie</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-border pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">What this page does not cover</h2>
        <p>
          This notice is about the website only. The MESvantage product processes manufacturing
          data on behalf of a customer under a separate data processing agreement. If you are
          evaluating the product, ask us for that agreement and the subprocessor list — and see
          our <a href="/evidence" class="text-accent font-semibold hover:text-accent-dark">evidence page</a>
          for which of those documents exist today and which we are still writing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
